<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>01 · 我们要解决的问题：教师带宽的物理上限</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 18, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            班级授课制三百年来底层逻辑未变：一个老师、同样的内容、同样的节奏、同样的作业。但每个学生的卡点并不相同。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 24, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>教师能看到什么</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8' }}>一个班级 50 人 · 一份作业</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#3D7BD9', marginTop: 8 }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>整卷得分与大致错题分布</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#3D7BD9', marginTop: 8 }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>凭经验猜测哪些题难、哪些题易</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#3D7BD9', marginTop: 8 }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>课后谈话才能了解学习状态</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>信息粒度：整题</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 76, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 2, height: 200, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', padding: 24, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>实际发生了什么</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8' }}>同一个学生 · 同一道题</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#D9534F', marginTop: 8 }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>第 3 步符号写错，后面全对</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#D9534F', marginTop: 8 }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>第 5 步方法选错，而非知识不会</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#D9534F', marginTop: 8 }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>这一问卡了 6 分钟才放弃</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>信息粒度：步骤 / 用时</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, padding: 18, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 44, background: '#FFC107' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>
                这不是老师不够努力，而是人脑带宽本来就不够——在班级规模下，逐步骤诊断物理上不可能完成。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 44, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F7F9FC', borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>高中数学 AI 学习系统 · 技术框架汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>02 / 24</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
